  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.39 “External candidate” means a person not employed by the state of New Hampshire in the classified system at the time of application for employment.\n\nSource. #10801, eff 5-17-15; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.35), eff 12-1-25",
